# The public origin the site is served from, with no trailing slash.
#
# Used for canonical URLs, hreflang alternates, og:url and og:image. Set this in
# your hosting provider's environment variables (on Vercel: Project Settings →
# Environment Variables) or those tags will point at the wrong domain and search
# engines will index the wrong URLs.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-custom-domain.com
